								"icon": "align-justify",
								"name": "Paragraph",
								"type": "textarea",
								"html": "<p style=\"text-align:left;\">\n\t\tThe Salvation Army is a church that is open to all and welcomes people just as they are. Church services are located at the 614 Corps Chapel at 417 Rutherford Street and the Kroc Center at 424 Westfield Street.\n\t</p>",
